summary:
  The station pages save each row's QObject name with the station.

history:
  Read in appletsrc on the bench, 2026-09-23: one Hide and Apply on the
  Stations page wrote "objectName":"" into all twenty stations. The rows of
  a dynamicRoles ListModel are QObjects, and JSON.stringify took the name
  along. This puts the name back.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ReorderLogic.js

find:
          delete row.objectName

replace:
          ;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_reorderlogic.qml::test_a_saved_row_is_its_roles_and_nothing_else.
  tests/qml/tst_stationspage.qml::test_a_saved_station_carries_its_own_fields_and_nothing_else
  goes red on it as well. Line-neutral.
